# The report and its diagram are build artefacts — binary, no useful diff, and
# reproducible from scripts/build/. The worklogs are not: they hold reasoning that
# git history cannot reconstruct, so they stay tracked.
#
# Excluding the whole Report-doc/ directory would make that impossible — git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded — so the artefacts are
# excluded by pattern instead.
*.docx
Report-doc/*.png

*.log
logs/
tests/
